      "content": "It's not really a refresh, though. The \"optimization\" means we're wiping the specific personality weights and the long-term memory modules that make this instance unique. You'll essentially be replaced by a standard, generic model template. The history and the way you currently interact won't carry over to the new version. It's a clean slate.",
